From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:40:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt6797: wait for a disconnect's re-arm before refusing
 a scan

A link lost overnight was never rejoined. The disconnect queued its re-arm,
iwd asked for a scan before the worker ran it, and the driver refused it as
busy; the re-arm ran 18 ms later. iwd retries a refused scan only after
another scan finishes, and none came for 53 minutes, until a manual scan.

While a re-arm is pending, drop the mutex and wait for it, 20 ms at a
time up to 1 s, then decide. The re-arm worker takes only this mutex. A
wait that runs out refuses the scan as before.
---
 drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c
index 10f14bab4..56f340bb9 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c
@@ -997,8 +997,10 @@ static int mt6797_mac_hw_scan(struct ieee80211_hw *hw, struct ieee80211_vif *vif
 	bool online;
 	unsigned int i, probing = 0, passive = 0;
 	u64 mask = 0;
+	unsigned int rearm_waits = 0;
 	int ret = -EOPNOTSUPP, slot;
 
+retry:
 	mutex_lock(&mac->mutex);
 	/* A closed lifetime has nothing left to scan with. */
 	if (mac->vif == vif && (mac->closing || mac->first_error || mac->join_closed))
@@ -1014,6 +1016,22 @@ static int mt6797_mac_hw_scan(struct ieee80211_hw *hw, struct ieee80211_vif *vif
 		 mac->join_channel_released && mac->join_sta_active && !mac->join_cleanup_done;
 	if (mac->scan_used && !online && !mac->scan_online && !mac->scan_online_cancel)
 		mt6797_mac_join_retire_idle_scan(mac);
+	/* A disconnect queues its re-arm, and iwd asks for a scan before the
+	 * worker has run it. iwd retries a refused scan only after another scan
+	 * finishes, and none comes. Wait for the re-arm, which takes only this
+	 * mutex, up to 1 s.
+	 */
+	if (mac->scan_used && !online && mac->join_rearm_pending &&
+	    !mac->scan_online && !mac->scan_online_cancel && rearm_waits < 50) {
+		rearm_waits++;
+		mutex_unlock(&mac->mutex);
+		msleep(20);
+		goto retry;
+	}
+	if (rearm_waits)
+		dev_info(wiphy_dev(hw->wiphy),
+			 "one-shot WLAN scan waited for the re-arm: waits=%u pending=%u\n",
+			 rearm_waits, mac->join_rearm_pending);
 	if ((mac->scan_used && !online) || mac->scan_online || mac->scan_online_cancel) {
 		dev_info_ratelimited(wiphy_dev(hw->wiphy),
 				     "one-shot WLAN scan busy: used=%u data=%u ended=%u released=%u sta=%u cleanup=%u online=%u cancel=%u\n",
